info.description:
Full test suite for every Memere API endpoint. Tokens and IDs are captured automatically by test scripts into collection variables.

Flow:
1. Run 'Register Teacher' → auto-sets {{access_token}}
2. Run 'Register Student' then 'Login Student' → sets {{student_token}}
3. Register Admin via 'Login Admin' (change role via Admin endpoints)
4. Work through folders top-to-bottom — each request captures the IDs needed by later requests.

